.tax?'warn':''}" style="margin-top:12px"><strong>Allocation: ${total}% of GDP.</strong> Tax revenue is ${state.tax}%. ${total>state.tax?'This budget adds to public debt.':'Surplus supports treasury reserves and debt reduction.'}</div><div class="control-row"><div class="control-top"><label>Average tax rate</label><output id="out-tax">${state.tax}%</output></div><input type="range" min="12" max="40" value="${state.tax}" oninput="setTax(this.value)"><div class="hint">Higher taxes improve revenue but can slow growth and public approval.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="grid two-col" style="margin-top:14px"><div class="card">${cardHead('Economic outlook','Interconnected indicators')}<div class="panel-body"><div class="notice">Infrastructure and education investment boost long-run growth. Defence, healthcare, and welfare strengthen security and stability. Persistent deficits raise debt and can crowd out future investment.</div><div class="pill-row"><span class="tag">GDP ₡${state.gdp.toFixed(0)}B</span><span class="tag">Exports ₡${(state.gdp*.21).toFixed(0)}B</span><span class="tag">Imports ₡${(state.gdp*.18).toFixed(0)}B</span><span class="tag">Treasury ${money(state.treasury)}</span></div></div></div><div class="card">${cardHead('Fiscal doctrine','A broad strategic direction')}<div class="panel-body"><select class="select" onchange="setPolicy(this.value)"><option ${state.policy==='Balanced growth'?'selected':''}>Balanced growth</option><option ${state.policy==='Austerity'?'selected':''}>Austerity</option><option ${state.policy==='Public investment'?'selected':''}>Public investment</option><option ${state.policy==='Industrial renewal'?'selected':''}>Industrial renewal</option></select><p class="hint">Doctrine introduces a persistent monthly nudge to economic outcomes. You can change it at any time.</p></div></div></div>`}
